cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  pyDADA2 is an unofficial Python port of the DADA2 R package. If you use it, please cite the
  DADA2 paper (preferred-citation below).
title: "pyDADA2: exact amplicon sequence variant inference (DADA2) for Python"
type: software
